# ref-16f7f4c-mesh-dense-contact
# Box dropped onto a dense triangle mesh patch, 100 steps at fixed dt=1/60, 4 substeps.
# Reference: vanilla float box3d at upstream commit 16f7f4c.
# Fixed: fixed3d on this branch (mesh-contact scratch in the per-worker arena, cap 512).
# Observable: contact count and resting height of the dropped box after 100 steps.
# Tolerance: resting height within 0.02 m and contact count equal, stated as twice the
#   measured maximum divergence once the reference harness (tools/reference/, from card
#   fixed3d-box3d-reference-harness) is present at the base; that harness is absent at
#   BASE sprint/fixed3d-box3d-ports (8f51d2d), so this scene is added for its glob and
#   the ctest -L reference run is reported not-done in the port record until it lands.
# No documented fixed-point divergence applies to this observable.
scene ref-16f7f4c-mesh-dense-contact
mesh wave 40 40 cell 1.0 amplitude 0.5 rowHz 0.1 columnHz 0.2
body box half 0.5 position 0 5 0 density 1.0
steps 100 dt 1/60 substeps 4
expect contactCount >= 1
expect restingY > -2.0
